# Accepted vulnerabilities for the uFawkes DevSecOps images.
#
# The release gate (images/devsecops/scan.sh) fails on any CRITICAL/HIGH
# vulnerability that has a fix in a package this repo controls (Debian, the
# locked Python/npm deps), unless its ID is listed here. Upstream prebuilt
# binaries are reported, not gated, so they never need entries here. Every
# entry needs a reviewed reason and an expiry, one per line above the ID, e.g.:
#
#   # CVE-2026-00000: not reachable (tool never parses untrusted input);
#   # expires 2026-12-31 — re-check at next apt snapshot bump.
#   CVE-2026-00000
#
# Keep this list empty unless a fix is genuinely unavailable to us.
